<%# The section 582(d) obligations that apply to every dispenser now, exemption or not. Checked 2026-11-13. %>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Authorized trading partners only.</strong> Buy from and sell to authorized trading partners:
    FDA-registered manufacturers and repackagers, licensed wholesale distributors and third-party logistics
    providers, and state-licensed dispensers.</li>
  <li><strong>Transaction records.</strong> Accept ownership of product only with its transaction information
    and transaction statement, and keep them for at least six years after the transaction.</li>
  <li><strong>Suspect product.</strong> Quarantine it and promptly investigate with your trading partners.</li>
  <li><strong>Illegitimate product.</strong> Within 24 hours of determining a product is illegitimate, notify
    FDA and the immediate trading partners you believe may have received it.</li>
  <li><strong>Requests for records.</strong> In a recall or an investigation of suspect or illegitimate product,
    give FDA or another appropriate federal or state official the records you received within two business
    days of a request (or another reasonable time FDA sets).</li>
</ul>
